{"agent":"dedupe-t4-links","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"`links` returns `sorted(self.link_entries.values(), ...)`, i.e. *every* entry, including those whose `relation` is `\"distinct\"`. But the module comment on `LINK_RELATIONS` defines `distinct` as a dismissal (\"I looked, these are different\") and states that \"the others are links\", and `linked()` (correctly) filters `relation != \"distinct\"`. So the two views disagree about what a \"link\" is. Concrete input: a record for which the only thing in the log is a single `link.recorded` with relation `\"distinct\"` against target `B` (no actual link entry). `record.links` then returns a non-empty list `[{\"relation\": \"distinct\", \"target\": \"B\", ...}]`, so any caller that walks `record.links` to render/expand \"what this record is linked to\" reports the dismissed pair `B` as a link — exactly the answer the domain model says is not a link (and which `record.linked()` correctly omits, so the two accessors give contradictory results for the same record). Either `links` should exclude `relation == \"distinct\"` (matching its own docstring \"The links…\" and `linked()`), or the raw ledger should be exposed under a non-link name.","digest":"05959bb3139330c3","location":"ddflow/core/model.py — `RecordLinks.links`","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/core/model.py — `RecordLinks.links`"}],"chunks_total":6,"coverage":"6/6 chunk(s) reviewed","diff_chars":20614,"diff_sha":"e01a8afb9df34d014ae617ba90443ec975ae98f22864671238b6a07da259f917","diff_source":"main..HEAD + working tree in /home/delian/src/.ddflow-worktrees/B-link-events","elapsed_s":318.3,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash","reason":"","reviewed":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewer_digest":"d34b8af1b4a590b5","status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/core/model.py — `RecordLinks.links`"],"unreviewed":[]},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"1 finding(s)"},"id":"e65b74812fa12c9fc3c8870d0","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":8142,"schema":1,"subject":"B-link-events","ts":"2026-10-02T06:22:40.275635Z"}
